Title: ariadneDB: curated graph of microbiome-related databases
Description:
    ariadneDB is the data package behind ariadne, providing the resource graph
    database that harmonises the links between several public biological
    databases with a focus microbiome-related resources. The harmonised resource
    graph is generated with a reproducible pipeline and stored in Zenodo. The
    ariadne and ariadnePy libraries can be used to explore and cross the ariadne
    graph in R and Python, respectively.
